@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 ---
 name: phial
-description: Work in the phial guest and consume the secrets that the host granted. Use when you drive the phial virtual machine, call a proxied API, use a granted SSH or GnuPG key, run a desktop app, or debug the guest kernel.
